Next.js can install sharp (Apache-2.0) and the libvips binaries (LGPL-3.0-or-later) for image
optimisation. TrustPCB does not use that feature, but the lock file lists them as optional
packages.

Font
----
The web app loads one font, Inter, from Google Fonts through next/font, which downloads it
at build time and serves it from the app. Inter is licensed under the SIL Open Font
License 1.1. The monospace text in the app uses the system's own font; no font file is shipped
for it.

Transitive dependencies keep their own licences; see the lock files.
